cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "CMG-PES Attitude Residual: Online PES Decoder Learning in Neuromorphic Residual UAV Attitude Control"
abstract: "A bounded online neuromorphic residual for quadrotor attitude control: six continuous coupled membrane-gate (CMG) units generate temporal features and an eighteen-parameter decoder adapts online through prescribed error sensitivity (PES), augmenting a saturated attitude controller with explicit authority bounds, exact recovery of the baseline when disabled, and a saturation-aware gate. Submitted to ACC 2027."
